reliably at scale remains a substantial engineering challenge, but the fundamental breakthrough

00:01:33.680 --> 00:01:36.940
already changes the boundary conditions we thought were fixed.

00:01:37.620 --> 00:01:41.400
One question we're sitting with is how devices that can shrug off temperatures,

00:01:41.740 --> 00:01:47.200
