00:10:45.070 --> 00:10:49.710
work that doesn't make headlines every week, but slowly changes the background assumptions of

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:55.970
many other fields. On a more practical materials front, scientists have proposed a fresh framework

00:10:55.970 --> 00:11:02.030
for studying how cracks grow in stressed materials. One that moves beyond the computationally

