a device that fails after two years and one that can be trusted for 20. Staying with material

00:11:40.290 --> 00:11:45.370
science researchers at COST have finally provided a clear, mechanistic explanation for a puzzling

00:11:45.370 --> 00:11:50.350
electrical effect that scientists and engineers have observed for years but never fully understood.

00:11:50.950 --> 00:11:57.170
The phenomenon occurs when water droplets contact hydrophobic surfaces. Those water repelling materials

00:11:57.170 --> 00:12:03.010
