00:12:12.910 --> 00:12:19.190
processes, the exact reason for the charge generation remained murky. The COST team's detailed analysis

00:12:19.190 --> 00:12:24.510
published in the journal Langmere maps out the molecular steps that lead to this charge separation.

00:12:24.850 --> 00:12:29.290
A clearer picture could influence the design of coatings, microfluidic systems,

00:12:29.870 --> 00:12:35.110
water harvesting technologies, and even certain biomedical implants where surface interactions matter.

00:12:35.110 --> 00:12:40.010
It's a lovely example of how even the simplest everyday interactions that material interfaces

00:12:40.010 --> 00:12:45.890
can still hold scientific surprises. A more speculative story comes from the stars, where the James

